<title>USA: Elm Grove, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Elm Grove, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird said it won $7.495 million of Elm Grove, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.117 percent.</p>
</text>
